WEBVTT

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.120
There's no need to hold back
for the civilians.

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:23.790
We will take over
the control tower at any cost

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:26.410
-to welcome His Excellency!
<i>-Yes, sir!</i>

00:00:37.290 --> 00:00:38.370
This looks bad.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:48.750
Don't you underestimate civilians!

00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:55.410
We're gonna protect this place
for those kids!

00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:56.950
Yeah!

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:02.870
How far are we going?

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:04.700
When can we go home?

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:06.250
Soon.

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:10.410
Mario and everyone else will chase the
enemy out of E-05 for us right away.

00:02:53.910 --> 00:02:54.750
Why...

00:02:56.580 --> 00:02:58.250
Why did you betray Adham?

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:04.160
<i>If you were gonna betray him now...</i>

00:03:04.790 --> 00:03:06.750
<i>why didn't you save Mom?</i>

00:03:07.870 --> 00:03:08.750
Tania...

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:13.250
If I stop the throne,

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:15.450
what'll happen to Mom?

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:19.000
The queen's life support

00:03:19.250 --> 00:03:21.750
and the throne's central system
cannot be separated.

00:03:22.370 --> 00:03:23.540
<i>Abandoning the throne...</i>

00:03:24.790 --> 00:03:26.250
<i>means Tania's death.</i>

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:31.040
<i>With no one to manage her now,</i>

00:03:31.700 --> 00:03:34.160
<i>the oxygen and nutrition supplies</i>
<i>have stopped,</i>

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:37.000
<i>and Tania is slowly heading</i>
<i>toward her death.</i>

00:03:38.250 --> 00:03:41.000
Even if we did nothing.

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:45.750
How could you say that so calmly?

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:49.000
You used Mom...

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:51.410
turned 07 into an insect cage...

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:55.160
and you just dump them all
when you're finished.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:58.450
You didn't need me either, right?!

00:03:59.290 --> 00:04:01.410
I bet you were disappointed
that I wasn't dead!

00:04:03.450 --> 00:04:04.410
Are you listening?!

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:13.500
Franz?

00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:22.580
Franz?!

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:29.160
To the right of the door...

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:37.080
<i>Retinal scan, clear.</i>

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:39.250
<i>The password...</i>

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:48.790
Memories of our hothouse...

00:04:53.160 --> 00:04:54.830
The memories of our hothouse...

00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:29.000
<i>The Imperial Ordinance System...</i>

00:05:30.160 --> 00:05:31.750
<i>It's the queen's throne...</i>

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:35.200
<i>that controls 07.</i>

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:47.080
<i>If you turn that lever...</i>

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:49.120
<i>everything will end.</i>

00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:54.450
<i>The Imperial Ordinance System will stop,</i>

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:56.250
<i>and the insect cage...</i>

00:05:57.200 --> 00:05:59.330
<i>will be released from human hands.</i>

00:06:00.700 --> 00:06:02.040
<i>You're a horrible person.</i>

00:06:04.160 --> 00:06:06.200
To feed everyone to the bugs...

00:06:06.660 --> 00:06:09.200
Is that your... Emeth Chilio's wish?

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:13.450
You're just going to use Mom
and discard her for that?!

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:17.080
Mom chose you and then had me.

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:18.950
That's what I heard from Acht.

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:21.830
What was so great about you?

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:25.120
You're selfish and have been obsessed
with your father forever!

00:06:25.330 --> 00:06:28.200
<i>I wished Griffith was my real dad!</i>

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:32.450
Griffith...

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:38.540
I had never thought of that.

00:06:39.700 --> 00:06:42.450
If Tania had chosen Griffith...

00:06:44.540 --> 00:06:45.450
<i>I don't think...</i>

00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:48.410
<i>I'd have liked that very much.</i>

00:06:49.830 --> 00:06:50.870
<i>Ilie.</i>

00:06:55.370 --> 00:06:56.200
<i>Franz?!</i>

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:01.290
I'll give you this insect cage.

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:04.870
<i>Become the queen here</i>

00:07:05.660 --> 00:07:07.500
<i>or live together with that Exterminator.</i>

00:07:08.160 --> 00:07:09.160
<i>Do as you wish.</i>

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:12.250
<i>But...</i>

00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:15.580
<i>please take care of Tania.</i>

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:19.290
<i>I don't want to let her die alone.</i>

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:23.790
<i>Don't throw that on me and end it there!</i>

00:07:24.700 --> 00:07:25.540
Listen to me!

00:07:26.160 --> 00:07:27.870
<i>I still have lots more to say to you!</i>

00:07:31.120 --> 00:07:32.040
<i>Dad!</i>

00:07:47.950 --> 00:07:48.790
If I...

00:07:50.200 --> 00:07:51.410
had screamed and...

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:53.160
cried in anger, too...

00:07:54.290 --> 00:07:57.540
would I have gotten through
to my dad a little?

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:16.040
Hey.

00:08:17.160 --> 00:08:20.040
Thanks for the invite, Mr. Specimen No. 8.

00:08:21.910 --> 00:08:23.580
Welcome, Exterminator.

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:27.500
I'm glad you made it

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:29.000
to the celebration.

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:35.580
The day where both
my shapeless brothers...

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:39.750
and foolish humans meet their end.

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:46.500
The insect cage will fall back
under the queen's control,

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:51.250
and the thieves will be put to trial
by the laws of nature.

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:55.580
Finally, everything will pay off.

00:08:57.330 --> 00:08:59.830
You were a better Exterminator
than I expected.

00:09:00.910 --> 00:09:02.200
To show my respect,

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:05.200
let me celebrate the new queen's
coronation by taking your head.

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:08.370
After I check to see if your
meat tastes the same

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:10.870
as the others with this tongue.

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:20.200
What's so funny?!

00:09:22.410 --> 00:09:24.700
You wanna become a monster that badly?

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:27.080
If you were a real bug,

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:29.660
you'd eat all of them
without leaving any leftovers.

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:31.040
Shut up.

00:09:31.910 --> 00:09:33.500
Cagasters aren't human.

00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:37.080
<i>What the Extermination</i>
<i>terms determined first was where</i>

00:09:37.160 --> 00:09:38.910
<i>to draw the line between man and bug.</i>

00:09:39.790 --> 00:09:42.200
Saying that killing bugs wasn't murder.

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:45.620
You don't kill humans to eat them.

00:09:45.950 --> 00:09:47.910
That's why you only
targeted Exterminators.

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:50.830
Because if an Exterminator killed you,

00:09:50.950 --> 00:09:52.580
you'd be able to die as a bug.

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:01.910
As you sip
the Exterminators' filthy blood,

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:05.410
you wait for the next chance you'll
get proven to be a monster, eh?

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:11.250
You're so pitiful,
you're making me tear up.

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:15.830
Come. I'm the Exterminator
who'll grant you that wish.

00:10:26.250 --> 00:10:27.910
Is the control tower holding?

00:10:28.870 --> 00:10:30.700
I can't get a hold of Hadi.

00:10:31.750 --> 00:10:32.660
I see...

00:10:33.870 --> 00:10:35.500
What about the civilian evacuation?

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:37.910
Aisha should be leading them,

00:10:38.450 --> 00:10:41.410
<i>but it's taking time since the elderly</i>
<i>and injured are among them.</i>

00:10:42.660 --> 00:10:43.500
Hurry!

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:46.620
We need to get as far away as possible
before the enemy comes!

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:50.370
Hang in there!

00:10:50.450 --> 00:10:52.290
Don't mind me.

00:10:52.660 --> 00:10:55.080
If we must die,
I'd rather just die here...

00:10:55.160 --> 00:10:56.330
I'll stay, too.

00:10:56.540 --> 00:10:58.870
I can't run while my husband
and father still fight!

00:10:59.330 --> 00:11:01.330
What do you think they're fighting for?

00:11:01.790 --> 00:11:04.080
The ones who can't fight
have a duty to stay alive!

00:11:04.450 --> 00:11:07.040
Don't give up by telling me
you wanna die with them!

00:11:10.040 --> 00:11:11.250
Damn it!

00:11:11.450 --> 00:11:13.080
We won't let you through here!

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:26.080
Isn't the enemy growing in number?

00:11:33.910 --> 00:11:35.500
We did what we could.

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:38.290
Let's brag about it
when we get to the other side.

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:43.660
Confirmed enemy troops
are being sent to the west gate!

00:11:44.330 --> 00:11:46.540
They're gonna try
and take it back to save face.

00:11:49.950 --> 00:11:52.160
This whole mess is the military's failure.

00:11:52.910 --> 00:11:55.450
We cannot allow any more damage
to the civilians.

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:03.750
Commander, this one
doesn't have any ammunition!

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:05.500
I know.

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:07.250
Qasim...

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:09.000
I'm borrowing this!

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:13.500
We are the shield of E-05!

00:12:14.200 --> 00:12:16.750
The victory of the shield
is not to destroy the enemy!

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:22.160
This is the Tank Unit's last fight!

00:12:22.950 --> 00:12:26.410
We will fight to the death
until all civilians make their escape!

00:12:26.950 --> 00:12:27.910
Yeah!

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:49.290
How persistent.
They're risking their lives to shoot us.

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:51.790
Should we wipe them out with the cannons?

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:54.660
We'll take the control tower undamaged.

00:13:01.330 --> 00:13:03.450
So, they've made it all the way here...

00:13:23.120 --> 00:13:24.330
Don't let anyone escape.

00:13:25.410 --> 00:13:27.580
After taking back the gate,
we'll go after them.

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:31.040
It'll be a pain if any survive
and spread the story.

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:36.540
-Al!
-And the enemy?

00:13:37.160 --> 00:13:38.870
They started their all-out attack.

00:13:39.450 --> 00:13:41.370
Even the south gate's tanks
came over here.

00:13:41.950 --> 00:13:44.700
No way! Tanks? Give me a break!

00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:48.040
Aisha, please escape in time!

00:13:54.620 --> 00:13:55.450
It's morning...

00:13:58.330 --> 00:13:59.870
You're stupid, Naji.

00:14:00.500 --> 00:14:02.540
The sun rises from the east.

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:04.330
What?

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:11.580
The Allied Forces!

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:16.450
<i>Mom...</i>

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:19.330
<i>A lot of things happened.</i>

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:26.290
<i>I became...</i>

00:14:26.870 --> 00:14:28.750
<i>a real shepherd with Griffith!</i>

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:30.330
<i>And then...</i>

00:14:30.910 --> 00:14:34.410
<i>I also became a waitress at a restaurant</i>
<i>run by this person called Ms. Mario.</i>

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:37.750
<i>She taught me how to brew really good tea!</i>

00:14:40.080 --> 00:14:41.500
I made a good friend, too.

00:14:42.200 --> 00:14:44.450
She's a lot more mature than I am,

00:14:44.700 --> 00:14:48.160
but she wants to become the leader
of a band of thieves in the future.

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:51.330
She says she'll always be my friend.

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:54.160
And...

00:14:55.250 --> 00:14:56.160
I...

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:58.750
have someone I like now.

00:15:15.790 --> 00:15:17.200
You're awesome,

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:18.910
Exterminator!

00:15:25.870 --> 00:15:27.250
There's no reason.

00:15:29.040 --> 00:15:30.790
Even if we were to look for one,

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:34.370
all we'd find is that we're
fated to live until it is time to die.

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:37.500
It's not like we can live as we wish,

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:40.450
and there's no need to live
how others wish us to either.

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:42.700
Mom.

00:15:43.330 --> 00:15:45.160
I'm sorry I had forgotten all this time.

00:15:45.580 --> 00:15:47.450
But I came back.

00:15:50.700 --> 00:15:52.450
Let's be together from now on.

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:17.910
<i>Initiating force-shutdown code.</i>

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:20.910
<i>All workers on the Central Nervous Floor,</i>

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:22.950
<i>please evacuate at once.</i>

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:26.750
<i>Initiating force-shutdown code.</i>

00:16:27.450 --> 00:16:29.700
<i>All workers on the Central Nervous Floor,</i>

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:31.660
<i>please evacuate at once.</i>

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:33.040
I see.

00:16:34.160 --> 00:16:35.120
She did it.

00:16:40.120 --> 00:16:41.500
So, she made it to see her.

00:16:43.040 --> 00:16:44.580
<i>The countdown will begin.</i>

00:16:45.450 --> 00:16:49.750
<i>Time until Imperial Ordinance System</i>
<i>destruction... 1000, 999...</i>

00:16:50.410 --> 00:16:53.790
<i>998, 997...</i>

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:55.540
<i>-996...</i>
-Tania...

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:00.540
-Fire the cannons!
<i>-Roger!</i>

00:17:06.160 --> 00:17:07.040
Enemy attack!

00:17:09.830 --> 00:17:11.120
Commander, it's dangerous!

00:17:11.540 --> 00:17:13.040
Just charge in!

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:15.540
Run!

00:17:32.870 --> 00:17:33.830
Everyone, get back.

00:17:34.330 --> 00:17:36.790
Don't worry, I won't let them
lay a finger on you.

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:44.290
<i>You wear the Allied Forces uniform,</i>
<i>but which unit?</i>

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:47.950
E-05 Eastern Allied Forces,
Anti-Insect Tank Unit.

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:51.120
By my commander's order and my own will,

00:17:51.580 --> 00:17:53.830
I prioritize the safety of the civilians.

00:17:55.620 --> 00:17:57.450
<i>I request you disarm yourselves.</i>

00:17:58.410 --> 00:18:00.950
Adham's party,
who invaded without warning,

00:18:01.370 --> 00:18:05.370
and the Allied Forces uniform
have no power over me right now.

00:18:08.160 --> 00:18:09.540
Good answer.

00:18:12.250 --> 00:18:13.700
<i>But put down your weapons.</i>

00:18:14.040 --> 00:18:16.580
<i>I guarantee the safety of the civilians.</i>

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:21.950
Do as he says.

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:24.040
Damn it...

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:29.330
<i>Very well.</i>

00:18:43.450 --> 00:18:45.120
What an utterly pathetic man.

00:18:45.330 --> 00:18:48.370
Taking the civilian's side
and betraying the military...

00:18:48.660 --> 00:18:50.120
Did I buy enough time?

00:18:51.370 --> 00:18:52.200
Do it.

00:18:53.370 --> 00:18:54.200
Commander!

00:18:54.910 --> 00:18:56.660
Don't! Forget me.

00:19:01.370 --> 00:19:03.540
An M1... Reinforcements?

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:10.160
Please don't shoot.

00:19:10.330 --> 00:19:11.790
We brought reinforcements.

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:25.870
We haven't heard about reinforcements!

00:19:26.160 --> 00:19:27.910
What is your unit and rank?

00:19:28.620 --> 00:19:33.330
Colonel Edoardo Petrov of the Eastern
Allied Forces General Headquarters.

00:19:34.870 --> 00:19:35.830
Petrov?!

00:19:37.620 --> 00:19:41.830
This city is under the command of Area E
Inspector-General Harb Adham's control.

00:19:42.250 --> 00:19:44.750
Currently, we are suppressing
a citizen-led riot.

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:46.250
Intervention is unnecessary!

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:48.870
It took two years for me
to catch up to him

00:19:48.950 --> 00:19:50.910
since he was dispatched
from the Far East...

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:52.450
Although,

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:55.950
it's short compared to the length
of Lieutenant-General Adham's scheme.

00:19:57.870 --> 00:19:59.370
Under suspicion of treason,

00:19:59.620 --> 00:20:01.950
we will apprehend
Lieutenant-General Harb Adham.

00:20:02.700 --> 00:20:04.370
The Far East and E-07.

00:20:04.910 --> 00:20:07.870
The one thing these two cities
that turned into insect cages share

00:20:08.160 --> 00:20:10.700
is that Lieutenant-General Adham
was stationed at both.

00:20:12.830 --> 00:20:17.450
Starting with the tragedy of the Far East,
Adham's scheme traces back 30 years ago.

00:20:18.120 --> 00:20:20.910
I'm sure there are many of you
who don't know the whole truth.

00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:23.160
If you surrender, we'll grant amnesty.

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:25.620
Damn General Headquarters' dog!

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:29.200
There's no point in listening
to some dog's lies!

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:32.370
-The west gate has been neutralized.
-Well done.

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:36.540
Continue on to secure footholds
at the Bazaar and control tower.

00:20:37.200 --> 00:20:38.250
Yes, sir!

00:20:40.500 --> 00:20:43.660
The fact is, we are both trained dogs,

00:20:44.120 --> 00:20:47.580
but this dog from the Far East
sure does play dirty.

00:20:49.450 --> 00:20:51.000
Enemy reinforcements have arrived!

00:20:51.120 --> 00:20:52.870
The west gate has been neutralized!

00:20:53.330 --> 00:20:54.290
What?!

00:20:54.790 --> 00:20:58.750
The reinforcements are the armored corps
under Colonel Edoardo Petrov.

00:20:59.830 --> 00:21:01.620
Edoardo Petrov...

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:09.750
Oh, Aisha! You're safe!

00:21:10.410 --> 00:21:12.370
Yes, everyone else is fine, too.

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:15.080
They're protected by the military
and are on their way.

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:16.540
Thank goodness.

00:21:17.080 --> 00:21:19.750
I fired like crazy, I'm all out of ammo.

00:21:21.120 --> 00:21:23.540
We will now attack
the enemy's main forces.

00:21:24.250 --> 00:21:26.870
Any soldiers in 05
that can fight, join us.

00:21:27.200 --> 00:21:28.950
Are you all mercenaries of 05?

00:21:36.870 --> 00:21:39.620
How rude. We aren't mercenaries.

00:21:40.080 --> 00:21:41.870
We're civilians who are fighting.

00:21:42.500 --> 00:21:47.410
<i>399, 398, 397...</i>

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:53.450
<i>396, 395, 394...</i>

00:21:53.950 --> 00:21:59.290
<i>393, 392, 391...</i>

00:21:59.830 --> 00:22:03.120
<i>390, 389...</i>

00:22:03.250 --> 00:22:05.250
-Mom...
<i>-388...</i>

00:22:05.870 --> 00:22:09.450
<i>-387, 386...</i>
-Come on out.

00:22:09.950 --> 00:22:12.910
<i>385, 384...</i>

00:22:14.410 --> 00:22:16.410
You don't need to hide anymore.

00:22:18.250 --> 00:22:19.080
<i>381...</i>

00:22:27.370 --> 00:22:28.200
<i>No one...</i>

00:22:29.330 --> 00:22:30.910
<i>can become your god.</i>

00:22:31.580 --> 00:22:36.620
<i>375, 374, 373...</i>

00:22:42.200 --> 00:22:43.040
<i>Acht.</i>

00:22:44.870 --> 00:22:47.660
<i>If you haven't decided</i>
<i>where you are going,</i>

00:22:48.660 --> 00:22:52.620
<i>please take my place</i>
<i>for her for a little while.</i>

00:22:57.080 --> 00:22:59.080
<i>Will Ilie hate me?</i>

00:23:00.950 --> 00:23:02.870
<i>Would she complain and ask me</i>

00:23:03.500 --> 00:23:04.830
<i>why I had her if she could</i>

00:23:05.870 --> 00:23:07.330
<i>only live her life this way?</i>

00:23:10.660 --> 00:23:11.580
<i>I don't care.</i>

00:23:14.080 --> 00:23:17.080
<i>If I can, I want to see her</i>
<i>just one more time.</i>

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:34.370
No! No!

00:23:34.450 --> 00:23:36.160
I don't want you to die!

00:23:36.250 --> 00:23:37.450
<i>170...</i>

00:23:37.540 --> 00:23:38.870
I came to see you!

00:23:39.370 --> 00:23:40.870
Not to kill you!

00:23:41.830 --> 00:23:43.540
I would never think that.

00:23:44.290 --> 00:23:45.370
Don't go!

00:23:46.040 --> 00:23:47.750
Don't leave me!

00:23:49.080 --> 00:23:50.080
Mom!

00:23:50.950 --> 00:23:52.040
Mom!

00:23:53.450 --> 00:23:54.790
Mom!
